# Never apply line-ending conversion to binary formats — CRLF conversion
# would corrupt byte-exact internal structures (e.g. a PDF's xref table,
# a DOCX's zip central directory). Git's own binary-detection heuristic
# missed some of these (small reportlab-generated PDFs lack the early NUL
# bytes it sniffs for), so they're declared explicitly rather than relied
# on to be auto-detected.
*.pdf   binary
*.docx  binary
*.doc   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.zip   binary
